# Only Yices' own API leaves the Yices shared library; see src/camada.exports
# for the format.
#
# Yices links GMP statically (--with-static-gmp), so without this the shared
# library exports ~72 GMP symbols of its own. Together with the copy Camada
# absorbs and any real libgmp in the process, that leaves several definitions
# of __gmpz_init and lets load order decide which one callers bind to.
yices_*
